{"id":"en_his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen","title":"His Hidden Girl? Now a Nobel Queen!","titleEn":"His Hidden Girl? Now a Nobel Queen!","description":"For seven years, Nina Wynn carried a silent love for Jason Shaw, a young master forever beyond her reach. A single drunken night tied them together in secret, but the bond fell apart the moment Jenna Song came back into his life. Devastated, Nina departed for Glorisia. Three years on, she comes home transformed into Prof. Ivy, a Nobel Prize-winning academic. The question now is whether Jason will see through the change and know the woman he had once turned away. Those curious about how the story unfolds can follow it on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Counterattack","Growth","Urban","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcujs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcujs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcujs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcujs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_his-hidden-girl-now-a-nobel-queen_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumb